{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the equation of the line passing through the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb3399f288c7a28ac2484b7bba72654ee4d9772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af424ab2c41e93a9e7ab081dee423809b2ba735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> in standard form?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/4/324abc1bfc00cbe78fb5549938af6e7277837436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  y=\\frac{3}{2}x-2 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  3x-2y=6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  2x+3y=-6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  3x-2y=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  2x-3y=6 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"816\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/3827ac52ef29e8ffea2557aafa1726b7076f8acd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = mx - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" /> be the equation of the line in slope-intercept form since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercept is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a6a917716191facf6d17308cdb8119392b77732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/7/a6767ed0ee4a650379c0882e6a970bd99b153d9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 3m - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/24562c30c8024e498054cd82a62feb7030c2a66d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"51\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab60c2f42d156f6917215f19db59aca9075d58e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{2}{3}x - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cdd539a19f2b74db15158f095bd8b5d9ba76ca46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y = 2x - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />. Rearranging the equation, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aaba0a8ce6010b261a3c875ce2d3b7c19827610d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 2x - 3y = 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The line must have an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a6a917716191facf6d17308cdb8119392b77732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. Of the answer choices, the only one with that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-intercept is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aaba0a8ce6010b261a3c875ce2d3b7c19827610d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 2x - 3y = 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"141\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a hr